Redistribution in the container image
-------------------------------------

The container image ghcr.io/offloadsecurity/offload-cli redistributes, unmodified,
the official release binaries of the four tools above, at the versions pinned in
scanners.env (also copied into the image at /usr/share/offload-cli/scanners.env).
Each binary's license file, taken from its upstream release archive, is
included in the image at /usr/share/licenses/<tool>/LICENSE. Those binaries
also contain third-party Go modules under their own licenses, as listed by each
upstream project. The image is based on Alpine Linux, whose packages carry
their own licenses, and the offload binary is built with the Go toolchain
(BSD-3-Clause, /usr/share/licenses/go/LICENSE).

The GitHub Action and install.sh (with --with-scanners) download the same
official release binaries from each project's GitHub Releases at install time.

